  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Ta có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mn>8</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>12</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>13</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math> m. Suy ra <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo>cos</mo><mover><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>13</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>12</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\t\tSuy ra <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>≈</mo><mn>53</mn><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>064</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>.<br> \n\t\t\tLấy các điểm <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>M</mi></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>N</mi></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>P</mi></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>Q</mi></semantics></math> lần lượt trên các tia <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> sao cho \n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mspace width=\"0.222em\"/><mover><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mspace width=\"0.222em\"/><mover><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mspace width=\"0.222em\"/><mover><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\tGọi <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>O</mi></semantics></math> là tâm của hình chữ nhật <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\t\tTa có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mover><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>O</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\t\tDo khung sắt ở vị trí cân bằng nên <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mover><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>P</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math>, với <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mover><mi>P</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math> là trọng lực tác dụng lên chiếc xe ô tô và khung sắt.<br>\n\t\t\tTa có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mover><mi>P</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>900</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>100</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>000</mn></mrow></semantics></math> N.<br>\n\t\t\tSuy ra <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>E</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>000</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>E</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>000</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\t\tTa có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>∥</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>. Suy ra <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>O</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>≈</mo><mn>53</mn><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>064</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\t\tDo đó <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>O</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>sin</mo><mover><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>O</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>000</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>sin</mo><mn>53</mn><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>064</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>6</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>255</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\t\tVậy độ lớn của các lực căng trên mỗi sợi cáp là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>255</mn></mrow></semantics></math> N.</div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/30689ad1c7c8a5597adfdca89cd3a6c2d85b580cff1de80203582cac749afcc6.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div>",
